<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078662" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro Celeberrimo atque Incomparabili
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Johanni Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p><rs key="B_991170515019905501" type="letter">Litteras tuas humanissimas</rs> 15 hujus deficientis Men<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sis Augusti a Te exaratas ante 8 dies accepi, easque
      <lb/>Nobilissimo Equiti ac <choice><abbr>D.</abbr><expan>Divi</expan></choice> Marci Procuratori <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410" type="person">Ruzzino</rs>
      <lb/>Patavini <rs type="organisation">Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i</rs> Moderatori Amplissimo com<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>municavi. Ex ipsius discursu deduxi desiderium,
      <lb/>Clarissimam ac Doctissimam tuam Personam
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs> conducendi, quo capitur; atque insuper
      <lb/>intellexi illum esse maxime dispositum ad te
      <lb/>vocandum cum salario, quod petivisti, 1500 Thale<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rorum imperialium, hoc est totidem unciarum ar<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>genti pro quolibet anno.<note type="comment" resp="SG">Michelotti gibt hier seine Deutung des Gesprächs mit <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-1089924410">Carlo Ruzzini</rs> wieder. Einen förmlichen Beschluss der drei Riformatori teilt er noch nicht mit. In seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019205501">Brief</rs> vom 9. November 1714 räumt er ein, dass die Riformatori die 1’500 Reichstaler im Wert von ebenso vielen Unzen Silber nie angeboten hätten. Über diesen Betrag sei zunächst nur zwischen ihm und Bernoulli verhandelt worden.</note> Ipse <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me petiit tuarum
      <lb/>epistolarum copiam<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Gemeint sind wohl Johanns <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515020205501">Brief</rs> vom 18. Juli und sein <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019905501">Brief</rs> vom 15. August 1714.</note> ut eas suis <rs key="pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">sodalibus</rs>
                   Nobilissi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mis in <rs type="organisation">Magistratu</rs> ostenderet, quod factum
      <lb/>puto. Reliquum igitur est ut sine mora mihi
      <lb/>rescribas num <choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> Patria tua discedes nec ne sala<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rio annuali 1500 Thalerorum imperialium tibi
      <lb/>persoluto: Si etenim non recusabis rem factam
      <lb/>esse existimo, et hi <choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimi</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell:<hi rend="sup">mi</hi></abbr><expan>Excellissimi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Modera<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tores</rs> te vocabunt spero, rogabuntque vestrum <rs type="organisation">Ma<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gistratum</rs> ut Tibi discessum per aliquot annos <choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> Pa<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tria Matheseos edocend<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> gratia permittat.</p>
<pb facs="1078663" n="2"/>
  <p><lb/>Deprecor et hortor benignitatem tuam ut hoc sala<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rium non recuses: etenim pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terquam quod opti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>mum est, progressu temporis poteris (et ego
      <lb/>coadiuvabo) <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatum</rs> tuum doctissimum substi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tuere, eique <rs type="organisation">Cathedram</rs> relinquere; ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m
      <lb/>in pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sentiarum facere oportet de hac re adhoc
      <lb/>ut Tu Vir Clarissime pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dicto salario promo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>vearis per aliquot annos. Uti in <rs key="B_991170515020005501" type="letter">aliis meis episto<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lis</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Vgl. Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515020005501">Brief</rs> vom 3. August 1714. Darin bot er Bernoulli an, während der Vorlesungsferien kostenlos in seinem Haus in Venedig zu wohnen und verpflegt zu werden.</note> admonui Domus mea erit pro Te toto vaca<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tionum tempore; mihique summi decoris erit Tui
      <lb/>esse in Mathematiciis (in quibus modice sum exer<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>citatus) discipulum. Si salarium 1.500 Tha<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lerorum imperialium recusas ambigo quin
      <lb/>Clarissimus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs> tuus, pro quo mea semper
      <lb/>interponam officia, <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavium</rs> advocetur.</p>
  <p>Tuum igitur per <rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs> expectabo <rs key="B_991170515019705501" type="letter">responsum</rs>
      <lb/>Vir Celeberrime. Interim te admonitum ve<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lim me accepisse non solum <rs key="B_991170515020205501" type="letter">tuam epistolam</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Johann I Bernoulli hatte in seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515020205501">Brief</rs> vom 18. Juli 1714 Streitigkeiten zwischen den Basler und den Mailänder Postverantwortlichen als mögliche Ursache der Verzögerungen genannt. Um weitere Zustellungsprobleme zu vermeiden, sandte er diesen Brief über Tirol.</note>
      <lb/>per <rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs> ad me amandatam, ver<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m etiam
      <lb/><rs key="B_991170517053305501" type="letter">eas</rs>, quas per <rs key="place_GEO-3182164" type="place">Bergomum</rs> transmisit <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Agnatus</rs>
<pb facs="1078664" n="3"/>
      <lb/>tuus, quem toto corde <choice><orig><g ref="#agrav">à</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> me salutatum cupio,
      <lb/>quemque magni facio, et rogo ut mihi parcat
      <lb/>si epistolis suis mihi carissimis non respondeo;
      <lb/>plurim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> enim Nobilium <choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>grotantium visitatio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nes, quibus quotidi<choice><orig><g ref="#egrav">è</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> sum oppressus impedimento
      <lb/>sunt ut plures conscribere possim epistolas.</p>
  <p>Fluidorum crassitiem duplici modo considerasti
      <lb/>quoad densitatem, et quoad consistentiam seu tenaci<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tatem; rogo nunc ut Fluidorum crassitiem consi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>deres quoad magnitudinem minimarum particu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>larum fluida coagmentantium; et definias mathe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>matice annon fluidum illud (tenacitate, et densita<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>te non considerabis) dicendum sit crassius, cuius parti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>cul<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> componentes sunt maiorum diametrorum. Rogo
      <lb/>ulterius ut mihi indices num tuta sit via mensu<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>randi particularum fluida data componentium
      <lb/>magnitudines ideoque crassitiem et subti<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>litatem fluidorum datorum dimetien<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>di per filtrationem eorundem fluidorum per po<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>ros dat<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> magnitudinis; ita ut si oleum <abbr>ex. gr.</abbr> per eos
      <lb/>poros non transeat, per quos aqua effluit, oleum aqu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>
<pb facs="1078665" n="4"/>
      <lb/>crassius sit dicendum, idest constare particulis maio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rum diametrorum.</p>
  <closer><salute>Vale Vir Amicissime et Celeberrime, et stipen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dium 1500 Thalerorum ne recuses rogo saltem
      <lb/>adhoc ut progressu temporis promoveatur
      <lb/>Clarissimus Nepos Tuus <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaus</rs>.</salute>
      <lb/><dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1714-08-31">31 Augusti 1714.</date></dateline></closer>
</div></body>
<back>
  <div type="attachment">
    <head>Beilage</head>
    <div type="editorialNote" resp="SG">
      <head>Editorische Vorbemerkung</head>
      <p>Dem vorliegenden Schreiben lag Michelottis <rs type="letter" key="B_991170517053105501">Brief</rs> an <rs type="person" key="pers_DE-588-135542286">Niklaus Bernoulli</rs> d. Ä. vom 31. August 1714 bei. In seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019605501">Brief</rs> vom 22. September 1714 erwähnt Michelotti diese Beilage im Postskriptum. Der Beilagenbrief ist gesondert ediert; die zugrunde gelegte Handschrift wird in der Universitätsbibliothek Basel unter der Signatur UBH L Ia 22:1 Nr.126 aufbewahrt.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</back>
